+---
+title: settings.json
+description: Canonical settings, profile fields, trust and reload behavior.
+---
+
+Settings resolve through [configuration layers](/en/docs/config). User settings are `~/.easy-agent/settings.json`; project and personal files are `.easy-agent/settings.json` and `.easy-agent/settings.local.json`.
+
+| Field | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `model` | Default saved profile ID, distinct from the upstream model |
+| `models` | Profiles with required protocol/model, one apiKey source, authentication, headers, maxTokens, capabilities and protocolOptions |
+| `modelRoles` | Profile IDs for background, think, longContext, compaction and webFetch |
+| `reasoning.mode` | auto (default), on, off |
+| `reasoning.budgetTokens` | Positive budget, jointly checked with output and context |
+| `reasoning.effort` | low, medium, high, max; validated by the selected protocol |
+| `allow`, `deny` | Permission rules; deny remains restrictive |
+| `mode`, `autoMode` | Permission mode, from user, explicit flags or policy only |
+| `additionalDirectories` | Extra file-tool boundaries, requiring trust |
+| `sandbox` | Shell sandbox settings and filesystem/network policy, requiring trust |
+| `hooks`, `disableAllHooks` | Lifecycle hooks and restrictive global disabling |
+| `mcpServers`, approved/disabled server lists | MCP resources, approval and exclusions |
+| `enabledPlugins`, `outputStyle`, `statusLine` | Extensions and output behavior |
+| `toolSearch`, `toolSearchAutoThreshold` | off/auto/on and 0–100 deferred-schema threshold |
+| `agentMdExcludes` | Safely merged absolute-path patterns excluding AGENTS.md / AGENT.md |
+| `checkpointingEnabled`, `cleanupPeriodDays` | File checkpoints and retention |
+| `maxTurns`, `respectGitignore`, `language` | Turn limit, search boundaries and response language |
+| `env` | Runtime environment injection; project values require trust and cannot replace parent credentials |
+| `syntaxHighlightingDisabled`, `prefersReducedMotion` | Terminal appearance |
+| `harnesses`, local `harness` | Agent definitions and personal workspace selection |
+
+Profiles and helpers cannot inject connections from an untrusted project. Restrictive deny, exclusions and hook disabling retain safety merges. Unknown profiles error; no protocol or fixed model is guessed. Unknown context uses a labelled 32000-token estimate; pricing stays unknown.
+
+`/config list` shows values, sources and reload policies with secrets redacted. Supported settings updates apply to the next request; environment edits need a new runtime. See [Model profiles](/en/docs/config/model-profiles), [environment](/en/reference/env) and [migration](/en/docs/config/migration).
